---
title: "Il Nodo"
---

![testata\_nodo\_02](/media/2015/06/testata_nodo_02.webp)

Il Nodo is the "Voice" of the Gruppo Alpinistico Presolana. A printed edition published twice a year, collecting articles by members who tell the best adventures of the past months, so that everyone, even the less tech-savvy, can share the passion for the mountains and the spirit that drives our outings.
